/**
 * updateBook — Modify an existing book by ID and return the updated object.
 *
 * @param {number} id — The book's unique identifier.
 * @param {Object} updates — Properties to update (partial object).
 * @returns {Book} The updated book object.
 * @throws {NotFoundError} If no book with the given ID exists.
