# Books REST API

A simple, educational REST API for managing books using Node.js and Express.js. This project demonstrates core REST API patterns including CRUD operations, error handling, middleware, and in-memory data storage.

## Prerequisites

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) v18 or higher
- npm (comes with Node.js)

## Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
