| Pattern | Why Chosen |
|--------|------------|
| **Separate route file** | Keeps app.js clean; enables independent testing of routes |
| **Custom `AppError` class** | Carries HTTP status codes for consistent error responses |
| **Global error middleware** | Centralizes error formatting; prevents漏 handling |
| **Async/await everywhere** | Future-proofs for async databases; cleaner control flow |
| **Query params for filtering** | REST convention; cacheable and URL-friendly |
