## Key Concepts Demonstrated

| Concept                  | Where                                    |
|--------------------------|------------------------------------------|
| RESTful resource URLs    | `/books`, `/books/:id`                   |
| HTTP method semantics    | GET=read, POST=create, PUT=update, DELETE=remove |
| Proper status codes      | 200, 201, 204, 400, 404                  |
| Custom error classes     | `errors.js` with `instanceof` support    |
| Global error middleware  | 4-arg `(err, req, res, next)` handler    |
| Input validation         | Required fields, type checks, ranges     |
| Modular routing          | Separate route files per resource        |
| In-memory storage        | Array with auto-incrementing IDs         |
| Query parameter filtering| `req.query` with genre/rating/year filters |
```

