## Design Decisions (Summary)

| Choice | Reason |
|--------|--------|
| In-memory array | Simple, no setup; swap for DB later without changing routes |
| Custom error classes | Semantic errors → correct HTTP status codes automatically |
| Async/await everywhere | Ready for database migration; no route changes needed |
| Separate route files | Each file has a single responsibility; easier to test |
| Consistent JSON envelopes | `{ data, meta }` for success; `{ error }` for failures |
| 204 on DELETE | Standard HTTP convention — no body needed for successful deletion |

